<title>UK: Whitbread sets 100 mln stg debenture stock.</title>
<headline>Whitbread sets 100 mln stg debenture stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WHITBREAD PLC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    09.DEC.21</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    =d.mmm.96</p>
