<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 2021 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
